sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant AdminUser
    participant AdminAPI as Admin API
    participant CreateWF as createStockLocationsWorkflow
    participant StockLocMod as Stock Location Module
    participant RemoteLink as Remote Link Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    Note over AdminUser, EventBus: Create Stock Location with Address

    AdminUser->>AdminAPI: POST /admin/stock-locations<br/>{ name: "Main Warehouse",<br/>  address: { address_1: "123 Commerce Blvd",<br/>             country_code: "US", city: "Portland" } }

    AdminAPI->>CreateWF: execute(input)

    CreateWF->>StockLocMod: createStockLocations([{<br/>  name: "Main Warehouse",<br/>  address: { address_1: ..., country_code: "US" }<br/>}])

    StockLocMod->>DB: INSERT stock_location_address<br/>{ address_1, country_code, city }
    DB-->>StockLocMod: laddr_01

    StockLocMod->>DB: INSERT stock_location<br/>{ name: "Main Warehouse", address_id: "laddr_01" }
    DB-->>StockLocMod: sloc_01

    StockLocMod->>EventBus: emit("stock-location.created", { id: "sloc_01" })
    EventBus-->>StockLocMod: ack

    StockLocMod-->>CreateWF: StockLocationDTO
    CreateWF-->>AdminAPI: StockLocationDTO
    AdminAPI-->>AdminUser: 201 { stock_location: { id: "sloc_01", ... } }

    Note over AdminUser, EventBus: Assign Location to Sales Channel

    AdminUser->>AdminAPI: POST /admin/sales-channels/:sc_id/stock-locations<br/>{ location_id: "sloc_01" }

    AdminAPI->>RemoteLink: create({<br/>  SALES_CHANNEL: { sales_channel_id: "sc_01" },<br/>  STOCK_LOCATION: { stock_location_id: "sloc_01" }<br/>})
    RemoteLink->>DB: INSERT sales_channel_stock_location<br/>{ sales_channel_id, stock_location_id }
    DB-->>RemoteLink: ok
    RemoteLink-->>AdminAPI: link created
    AdminAPI-->>AdminUser: 200 ok

    Note over AdminUser, EventBus: Delete Stock Location

    AdminUser->>AdminAPI: DELETE /admin/stock-locations/sloc_01

    AdminAPI->>StockLocMod: deleteStockLocations(["sloc_01"])
    StockLocMod->>DB: UPDATE stock_location<br/>SET deleted_at = now()<br/>WHERE id = 'sloc_01'
    DB-->>StockLocMod: ok

    StockLocMod->>EventBus: emit("stock-location.deleted", { id: "sloc_01" })
    EventBus-->>StockLocMod: ack

    StockLocMod-->>AdminAPI: void

    AdminAPI->>RemoteLink: removeLinks({ STOCK_LOCATION: { stock_location_id: "sloc_01" } })
    RemoteLink->>DB: DELETE sales_channel_stock_location<br/>WHERE stock_location_id = 'sloc_01'
    DB-->>RemoteLink: ok

    AdminAPI-->>AdminUser: 200 { id: "sloc_01", deleted: true }
